[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u304C\u62B1\u3048\u3066\u308B\u554F\u984C\u3002\u305D\u308C\u306F\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3068\u30B3\u30F3\u30D3\u3092\n\u3000\u7D44\u3093\u3067\u308B\u82B8\u4EBA\u3068\u3044\u3046\u8B0E\u306E\u5370\u8C61\u304C\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3063\u305F\u3053\u3068\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(My current problem is that people have this strange impression that Firis and I are some kind of comedy duo.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u308C\u306F\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u304C\u5929\u624D\u3068\u547C\u3070\u308C\u3001\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u304C\u8A02\u6B63\u3059\u308B\u3068\n\u3000\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u304C\u9762\u767D\u304C\u3063\u3066\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306E\u771F\u4F3C\u3092\u3059\u308B\u306E\u304C\u539F\u56E0\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This all started because when people call Firis a genius and I correct them, she finds it amusing and starts imitating me.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u306E\u6D41\u308C\u3092\u65AD\u3061\u5207\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u306F\u3001\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306E\u307B\u3046\u304C\u3001\n\u3000\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3088\u308A\u5929\u624D\u3060\u3068\u6B63\u3057\u304F\u77E5\u308C\u6E21\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(To break this cycle, I just need to make everyone understand that I\u0027m the real genius, more so than Firis...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u3046\u3059\u308C\u3070\u3042\u306E\u6D41\u308C\u304C\u5DFB\u304D\u8D77\u3053\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3053\u3068\u306F\u306A\u3044\uFF01\n\u3000\u305D\u3057\u3066\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3092\u8A3C\u660E\u3059\u308B\u65B9\u6CD5\u3002\u305D\u308C\u306F\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Then that whole routine won\u0027t happen anymore! And I know exactly how to prove it...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u3088\u308A\uFF01\n\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u306E\u516C\u8A8D\u8A66\u9A13\u3092\u958B\u50AC\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3063\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I hereby announce the official alchemist certification exam!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3063\u3001\u306A\u3093\u3060\u306A\u3093\u3060\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-What\u0027s going on?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u901A\u884C\u4EBAA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308C\u3063\u3001\u3042\u306E\u5B50\u3063\u3066\u4F8B\u306E\u82B8\u4EBA\u306E\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, isn\u0027t that the comedian from..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u901A\u884C\u4EBAB",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3066\u3044\u3046\u304B\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3063\u3066\u8A66\u9A13\u53D7\u3051\u3066\u306A\u308B\u3082\u3093\u306A\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, you need to take an exam to become an alchemist?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u901A\u884C\u4EBAC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3088\uFF01\u3000\u4ECA\u5F8C\u30E9\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CA\u3067\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3092\u540D\u4E57\u308B\u306B\u306F\u3001\n\u8A66\u9A13\u306B\u5408\u683C\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u5FC5\u8981\u3068\u3059\u308B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s right! From now on, to call yourself an alchemist in Lantarna, you must pass this examination!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3057\u3066\uFF01\u3000\u8A66\u9A13\u306F\u4ECA\u304B\u3089\uFF11\u5E74\u5F8C\uFF01\n\u307F\u3063\u3061\u308A\u935B\u3048\u3066\u81E8\u3080\u3088\u3046\u306B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And! The exam will be held one year from now! Make sure you train hard until then!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3068\u3001\u30B3\u30B3\u304C\u4E00\u756A\u5927\u4E8B\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u8A66\u9A13\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u308B\u306B\u306F\u516C\u8A8D\u63A8\u85A6\u72B6\u304C\uFF13\u679A\u5FC5\u8981\u3060\u304B\u3089\u2500\u2500",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And here\u0027s the most important part\u2014you\u0027ll need three letters of recommendation from certified alchemists to take the exam\u2014"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3001\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\u6D3E\u624B\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3084\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306A\u3041\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u3067\u3082\u63A8\u85A6\u72B6\u66F8\u3051\u308B\u4EBA\u304C\u4E09\u4EBA\u3082\u3044\u308B\u3063\u3051\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-Ilmeria\u0027s really going all out... But are there even three people who can write recommendations?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u307E\u3055\u304B\u5FD8\u308C\u305F\u308F\u3051\u3067\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3088\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie... Surely you haven\u0027t forgotten?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\u3001\u4F55\u304C\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Forgotten what?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30B9\u30C6\u30A3\u30F3\u306E\u5236\u5EA6\u3067\u3044\u3048\u3070\u3001\u30E9\u30A4\u30BB\u30F3\u30B9\u6240\u6301\u8005\u306F\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3001\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3001\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2\u3057\u304B\u3044\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Under Rastin\u0027s system, you, Firis, and Ilmeria are the only licensed alchemists."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3063\u305F\u304F\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u3082\u3046\u5C11\u3057\u81EA\u899A\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3089\u308F\u306A\u3044\u3068\u56F0\u308A\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really now... You need to be more aware of your position."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u30E9\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CA\u306B\u306F\u8272\u3093\u306A\u3059\u3054\u3044\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u304C\n\u96C6\u307E\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3060\u308D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But aren\u0027t there lots of amazing alchemists gathered here in Lantarna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AA\u30B9\u30AB\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oskar"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u306E\u306B\u30E9\u30B9\u30C6\u30A3\u30F3\u304B\u3089\u6765\u305F\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3060\u3051\u304C\u516C\u8A8D\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u504F\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u304B\u3001\u5909\u306A\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isn\u0027t it kind of weird that only alchemists from Rastin are officially recognized?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AA\u30B9\u30AB\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oskar"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307F\u3093\u306A\uFF01\u3000\u96E3\u3057\u304F\u8003\u3048\u306A\u3044\u3067\uFF01\n\u3053\u308C\u306F\u305F\u3060\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3092\u540D\u4E57\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306E\u8A66\u9A13\u306B\u904E\u304E\u306A\u3044\u308F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone! Don\u0027t overthink it! This is just an exam to determine who can call themselves an alchemist!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u8A66\u9A13\u306B\u5408\u683C\u3057\u305F\u3089\u3053\u306E\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And those who pass the exam will receive..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u305F\u3061\u3068\u540C\u3058\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u8863\u88C5\u3092\u30D7\u30EC\u30BC\u30F3\u30C8\u3059\u308B\u308F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The same cute outfit that we wear!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u805E\u3044\u305F\u304B\u3063\uFF01\uFF1F\n\u3042\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3063\u3066\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did you hear that?! They\u0027re giving away those outfits!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u901A\u884C\u4EBAA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D76\u5BFE\u6B32\u3057\u3044\u308F\u2026\u2026\uFF01\n\u3042\u306E\u5B50\u305F\u3061\u306E\u30D5\u30A1\u30F3\u306E\u540D\u306B\u304B\u3051\u3066\u4F55\u304C\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3082\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I absolutely must have one...! As their biggest fan, I\u0027ll do whatever it takes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u901A\u884C\u4EBAB",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308A\u3083\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u3061\u3083\u3044\u3089\u308C\u306D\u3048\uFF01\n\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u306E\u52C9\u5F37\u3057\u306A\u304F\u3061\u3083\u3088\u3049\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, what are we waiting for?! Time to start studying alchemy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u901A\u884C\u4EBAC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3075\u3001\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u3053\u308C\u304F\u3089\u3044\u306F\u76DB\u308A\u4E0A\u304C\u308B\u308F\u3088\u306D\u3002\n\u30B3\u30EB\u30CD\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306B\u5927\u91CF\u767A\u6CE8\u3057\u3066\u304A\u3044\u3066\u6B63\u89E3\u3060\u3063\u305F\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe, I knew this would get everyone excited. It was the right call to place that bulk order with Corneria."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3080\u3075\u3080\u3002\u3053\u308C\u306F\u4E45\u3005\u306E\u91CF\u8CA9\u7E41\u5FD9\u671F\u306E\u5230\u6765\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u3044\u3064\u3082\u3088\u308A\u6C17\u5408\u5165\u308C\u3066\u9811\u5F35\u308B\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, hmm. This looks like the busiest sales period in quite a while. I\u0027ll have to put in extra effort."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B3\u30EB\u30CD\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Corneria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u5929\u624D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u8863\u88C5\u3092\u516C\u8A8D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u304C\u7740\u3066\u3001\n\u305D\u306E\u4E2D\u3067\u3082\u4E00\u756A\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cute genius alchemist outfits worn by certified alchemists, and the cutest of them all being Firis...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rianne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u304D\u308B\u2026\u2026\uFF01\u3000\u79C1\u306B\u306F\u60F3\u50CF\u3067\u304D\u308B\u308F\uFF01\n\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306E\u4E2D\u3067\u4E00\u756A\u306E\u8F1D\u304D\u3092\u898B\u305B\u308B\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can see it...! I can imagine it! Firis shining more brilliantly than anyone else!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rianne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306E\u898B\u308B\u3057\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\uFF01\n\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3001\u79C1\u306F\u5168\u529B\u3067\u652F\u6301\u3059\u308B\u308F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I absolutely have to see that! Ilmeria, you have my full support!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rianne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3001\u304A\u3044\u304A\u3044\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u3044\u3044\u306E\u304B\uFF1F\u3000\u3053\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u52DD\u624B\u306B\u3084\u3063\u3061\u307E\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-Hey now... Is it really okay to do something like this on your own?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AA\u30B9\u30AB\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oskar"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3041\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306B\u771F\u5263\u306B\u8003\u3048\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\uFF1F\n\uFF11\u3064\u306E\u304A\u796D\u308A\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3067\u697D\u3057\u305D\u3046\u3058\u3083\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, we don\u0027t need to take it too seriously, right? It\u0027s like a fun festival!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\u306D\u2026\u2026\u3002\u3053\u3046\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3063\u305F\u4EE5\u4E0A\u3001\n\u96E3\u3057\u304F\u8003\u3048\u305A\u3042\u308A\u306E\u307E\u307E\u3092\u697D\u3057\u3080\u307B\u3046\u304C\u3088\u3055\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed... Now that it\u0027s come to this, it might be better to simply enjoy it for what it is rather than overthink things."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3067\u4E8C\u4EBA\u3068\u3082\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306B\u51B7\u9759\u306A\u3093\u3060\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why are you both so calm about this..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AA\u30B9\u30AB\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oskar"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3075\u3063\u3075\u3063\u3075\u3063\u2026\u2026\uFF01\u3000\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306F\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306E\u601D\u60D1\u901A\u308A\uFF01\n\u3000\u63A8\u85A6\u72B6\u3092\u66F8\u3051\u308B\u306E\u306F\u3001\u3053\u308C\u3067\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u305F\u3061\u4E09\u4EBA\u3060\u3051\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Hehehehe...! Everything is going according to plan! Now only us three can write letters of recommendation!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3042\u3068\u306F\u5408\u540C\u3067\u63A8\u85A6\u72B6\u767A\u884C\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306E\u8AB2\u984C\u3092\u8A2D\u5B9A\u3057\u3066\u3001\n\u3000\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306E\u307B\u3046\u304C\u7684\u78BA\u306A\u8A55\u4FA1\u3092\u3057\u3055\u3048\u3059\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(All I need to do now is set up joint evaluation criteria for the recommendations and make sure my assessments are more precise!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3088\u308A\u3082\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u304C\u5929\u624D\u3060\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u2026\u2026\n\u3000\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306E\u524D\u3067\u76DB\u5927\u306B\u898B\u305B\u3064\u3051\u3066\u3042\u3052\u308B\u308F\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I\u0027ll show everyone, in spectacular fashion, that I\u0027m the real genius... not Firis!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u30FC\u3063\u306F\u3063\u306F\u3063\u306F\u3063\u306F\u3063\u306F\u3063\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahahahaha!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u52DD\u8CA0\u3088\u3001\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s on, Firis!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u690D\u7269\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u8ABF\u3079\u306A\u304C\u3089\u65C5\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u5C11\u5E74\u3002\n\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u3068\u306F\u540C\u90F7\u306E\u89AA\u53CB\u540C\u58EB",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A young man who travels while studying plants. A close friend of Sophie from their hometown."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30AA\u30B9\u30AB\u30FC\u30FB\u30D9\u30FC\u30EB\u30DE\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oskar Behlmer"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u738B\u90FD\u3092\u62E0\u70B9\u306B\u6D3B\u52D5\u3059\u308B\u5546\u4EBA\u3002\n\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3067\u3082\u3042\u308A\u3001\u305D\u306E\u529B\u3092\u5E97\u306E\u7D4C\u55B6\u306B\u6D3B\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A merchant based in the capital. Also an alchemist who uses her skills to help run her store."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B3\u30EB\u30CD\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Corneria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]